{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_151_1003_p", "source_sha256": "78566fc1cb33dad65e4ccc3915be099cefcd17f30a05508eeeaf349c16006abb", "ja": "あそこまで言われたら、\n少しは自信ついたんじゃないか？", "zh": "被夸成那样，多少也有点自信了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_151_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "abcae95b8f5b21a9405a71ba56781a47e1ebab6dc4c813b736797db59359368b", "ja": "自信がついたっていうか……「こんなにたくさんの人が\n応援してくれてるんだ」って、胸が熱くなったかな？", "zh": "与其说是有了自信……不如说是觉得“原来有这么多人在支持我啊”，心里热乎乎的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_151_1005_043nor", "source_sha256": "9f6342f429cc23f4ffbfc105cbb2aa559cdd7dab3f10ccb49ebf7b91f9f110c7", "ja": "さすがに、「やっぱアタシってカワイイ！」なんて\n思えるまではいかないけどさ。えへへ……。", "zh": "虽然还没到能觉得“果然我还是很可爱！”的程度啦。嘿嘿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_151_1006_p", "source_sha256": "8c473fa52617a3355f53cf85222c30861947cd0fc6b18c687d6542ac3b9dc338", "ja": "はは、そうだな。\nそんなにすぐ変わるものでもないよな。", "zh": "哈哈，是啊。\n也不是那么快就能改变的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_151_1007_043nor", "source_sha256": "8cdcdafcec537978ffaef3e8c67ab51d9e017fa6760e3de6631d826e88e3d259", "ja": "あのね、{$P$}。\n……笑わないでくれる？", "zh": "那个啊，{$P$}。\n……你可别笑话我哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_151_1008_p", "source_sha256": "b8ec80e8bc0f90e88af378d702486268a3f4ef1faa70324dcfedf9a2cbc6e83f", "ja": "？　もちろん。何だ？", "zh": "？当然。怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_151_1009_043nor", "source_sha256": "203abafbfcf82310034b58cbb86ef9fe92a9caeeacaaebda9ec87d7d3347e653", "ja": "うん。あのね、アタシ……\n本当は、憧れてたんだと思う。『カワイイ』に。", "zh": "嗯。那个，其实我……\n我想，我一直憧憬着“可爱”吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_151_1010_043nor", "source_sha256": "87d57add54ee51668a692eb909f1aa2a6ab4c3afca5e13a766ffd5cb4dc1ffb1", "ja": "ずっと、「そういうのはアタシのガラじゃない」って\n思ってたけど。でも……好きっていうか。憧れ。", "zh": "一直觉得，“那种东西不适合我”。\n但是……该说是喜欢吗。更像是憧憬。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_151_1011_p", "source_sha256": "01dfbf0b9b426403d7e3c47d2de07ddc85c0a0a0b965e56d5cc1b02ef261ac69", "ja": "うん。", "zh": "嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_151_1012_043nor", "source_sha256": "c0bc143f5549f11267bb770ff17a43bb75d43a07b794d7abaed9686ab3a5d83c", "ja": "だから、そういうの全部ひっくるめて、「それも\nアタシなんだ！」って、受け入れることにしたっ！", "zh": "所以，我决定把这一切全部包容进去，接受“那也是我啊！”这一点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_151_1013_043nor", "source_sha256": "032d08232680464d46eb248e8d6629fb74068e6136a1464c7f96318e92def77e", "ja": "みんなみたいでなきゃ、トップは目指せないんじゃ\nないかって思ってたけど……でも、決めたから。", "zh": "我曾以为，如果不能像大家那样，就没法以顶尖偶像为目标……但是，我已经下定决心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_151_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "a289a78a38243691bbcb5802fd6c867c8fbf7d508963570932a8f297c2e54abe", "ja": "もう迷わない。よそ見なんかしない。アタシは\nアタシで、まっすぐにトップアイドルを目指すよ！", "zh": "我不会再迷茫，也不会再东张西望。我会做自己，朝着顶级偶像笔直前进！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_151_1015_p", "source_sha256": "fc6cc215a65f0905924a74ec7132e586efdf7ea93e465a3301cbe5a2b4d02b03", "ja": "のり子……。", "zh": "法子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_151_1016_043nor", "source_sha256": "99243ffa32aebeafd83fac4c5e82eebb03e4b44474a5ae0848623571463c1b1c", "ja": "そりゃ、周りは強敵ばっかだしさ？　また\n自信がなくなることも、あるかもしれないけど……。", "zh": "毕竟，周围全都是强敌嘛？说不定……也会再次失去自信……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
