{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_151_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_151_1018_p", "source_sha256": "b00ff73422a367869d14e5e0ff6945eaf4dfa94c54c4f707508cdc210268efa8", "ja": "ああ、もちろん。二言はないよ。", "zh": "啊，当然。我说话算话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
